WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.150
Previously on <i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.570
I'm Kanon Shibuya and
I'm a first-year in high school!

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.410
I love singing, but I failed to get into
the music program at my school.

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:10.490
This sucks!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.240
"Let's be school idols"

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:11.410
And somehow,

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.280
I was asked to be a school idol!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.080
Please, sing with me!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.750
Does anyone want to become
a school idol with me?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.870
Me? An idol?!

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.340
Nope, nope, nope! I mean,
I can't sing in front of people!

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.880
But I do love to sing. I want to do
something big with my singing.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.930
My yet unknown feeling is on the move!

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:41.310
♬ I love café au lait and baked apples ♬

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:45.570
♬ Don't forget the tomatoes ♬

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:50.200
♬ Hamburg steaks are great, too ♬

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.200
What the?

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.910
I'd like to know myself.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:54.450
Morning!

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.660
Hey, you're a second-year starting today!

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.120
Let's eat!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.370
Manmaru! I'll see you later!

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.580
♬ Hamburg steaks are great, too ♬

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.000
Seriously, what?!

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.760
Yes! Yes!

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.090
I was able to sing in front of people!

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.770
A school idol!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.810
That's how I'll be able to sing!

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:30.070
<i>You can't stop real dreams</i>

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:35.780
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.120
Love Live! Superstar!!

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.120
Love Live! Superstar!!

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:56.850
<i>Before we knew it,</i>
<i>we found something that we loved</i>

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.390
<i>Let these feelings reach you</i>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.020
<i>We've made up our minds, we're serious!</i>

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.810
<i>I wonder what we can do</i>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.730
<i>The sky's so bright</i>

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:13.150
<i>Let's look up at it</i>
<i>and sing our hearts out</i>

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:17.280
<i>Doesn't having something you want to do</i>

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:19.950
<i>Make every day fun?</i>

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:25.000
<i>Do you feel that way, too?</i>

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.290
<i>Ah, we've been waiting for this moment</i>

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.340
<i>This encounter is where we start</i>

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:35.800
<i>Our dreams are drawn together,</i>
<i>and it all begins</i>

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:41.520
<i>We realized our true desires and now,</i>
<i>we can't be stopped</i>

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.900
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:52.740
<i>As fast as they can run</i>

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.950
We got rejected.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.200
Huh? What happened?

