00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.620
You turned it in?

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:10.750
I was told again that this school
didn't need school idols...

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.420
...by Hazuki-<i>san</i>.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.920
That scary girl.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:22.010
From what I heard, clubs are temporarily
being managed by the student council

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:25.770
which she's in the center of...

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.480
So we have to get their approval.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:30.180
No 
School 
Idols
 Allowed?!

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.360
Leave it to me!

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.150
My answer remains the same.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:35.730
"Drama Club"
"Looking for new members"

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.570
Why?

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:36.240
I'd rather not explain
the same thing twice.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:39.410
Well, I don't get it!
We're talking about a club!

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:43.790
What's wrong with students
getting together to do what they want?!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.210
There is something about school idols
that could be considered music.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:48.420
And?

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.880
Do you not understand?!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.710
Yuigaoka has a dedicated music program

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.920
and therefore we must be
superior to any other school

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.930
when it comes to any musical activity,

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:01.850
or the value of our school will go down!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:05.850
So you're saying we have to be
at a higher level.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.230
That's no problem! With me and Kanon-<i>san</i>--

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.440
Can you really say that?!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.690
There are school idols
at many schools now.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:20.860
Are you saying that you two could
properly represent our school

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.200
without embarrassing us
among all of that competition?

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.250
You're going to say all that
before we even start?

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.790
I'll say this one more time.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:32.540
We must be superior to every other
school in every musical activity,

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.840
or the value of our school will go down.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:40.260
We must not be inferior to other schools
with our musical activities.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:46.270
If you're insistent on doing this,
you should go to another school.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.850
But...

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.560
Let's go, Kanon-<i>san</i>.

