00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.280
Kanon-<i>san</i>, you should fill this out, too.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.320
This is...

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.360
An application to quit the school.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.150
What?!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:01.820
Quit?!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.030
On the second day?!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.530
Yeah, that's the expected reaction!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.790
There's no point in
staying at this school.

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:10.120
Let's become school idols
at another school.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.670
Yeah, that's not happening.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:12.500
It's okay!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.630
We'll be able to transfer to a different
school by taking a transfer exam.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.630
Where is your house?

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.510
Right here.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:21.260
Oh, right. Let's see
what schools are around here...

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.430
Wait, wait! I get how you feel...

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:27.390
But there's no way
my parents will okay this.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.390
Sis...

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:29.640
You want to quit school?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.600
I don't! Don't worry!

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:36.730
Why is this happening?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.280
Sorry... After I told you
to leave it to me.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:43.490
Oh, no! You're very kind, Kanon-<i>san</i>.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:48.590
Truly kind! If I hadn't come to
this school, I never would've met you.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:53.430
That's why I want to be school idols
with you, no matter what.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:54.640
Thank you.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.600
No, thank you!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:01.360
But there are a lot of people
who don't really like school idols.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:06.240
There were a lot of people around me
who also made fun of them because of that.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:11.710
But I truly believe that
school idols are magnificent.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.630
Me, too.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.380
Really?!

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:16.970
I get why you're so into them, Keke-<i>chan</i>.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:21.570
I don't know everything about them yet,
so I can't be completely sure, but...

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.240
I'm so happy!

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:27.570
I'll do whatever I can
to help make a School Idol Club.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.180
♬ Yo! I love Manmaru roundy! ♬

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.340
♬ As much as candy! ♬

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.960
♬ The full moon is grandy!
So I love all things roundy! ♬

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.710
That girl goes to our school...

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.670
Heyo! Manmaru!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:50.560
You're just so perfect and round!

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.600
Well? Did you find any of
that Ren girl's weaknesses?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.980
Hey, I just got here!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.310
Sorry!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.810
Anything will work!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.480
Like a group she's enemies with,

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.450
or like she's absolutely
terrified of ghosts...

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:07.780
Anything that'll give us the upper hand!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.290
Well... To put it simply, her weakness...

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.370
Yeah?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.830
Her weakness...

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.870
Her weakness?

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.540
Her weakness...

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.250
Her weakness?!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.420
...doesn't exist, yo!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:27.010
I asked a bunch of kids
from the music program.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:28.640
She's smart.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.890
She's athletic.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:33.180
She's a great leader.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.230
There're actually a bunch of people
who rely on her.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:41.820
And apparently, the director knows
her mom, Hana Hazuki-<i>san</i>.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:45.400
So in other words, it's probably
going to be super hard

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.320
to turn around her decision.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:51.370
So hey, have you thought about
making another club

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.620
or joining another club
and singing there for now?

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:54.910
Another club?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.420
Yeah. Continue in a club
where you won't get yelled at

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.500
and then make a School Idol Club
when you get a chance?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.500
That won't work.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.460
Why?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.010
If we let this go on,

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:08.430
that means Hazuki-<i>san</i>
can have her way with our school,

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:09.720
and that can't happen!

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.850
Yeah, okay. But she didn't approve
the School Idol Club, right?

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:17.680
Then I'll think of something else!
Keke-<i>chan</i>'s really down about this.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.810
Yeah, but...

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:20.730
Not to mention

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:25.360
it'd be really rude for me to
join another club for that reason.

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:31.240
And I... I'm really interested
in school idols now.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.280
Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.910
What did you just...

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:39.370
You? An idol?!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.420
Give us freedom!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:44.960
It's wrong that we cannot
freely pursue club activities!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.420
Club activities should always
be equal and fair!

