00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:58.230
This probably isn't it...

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:01.850
Kanon-<i>san</i>! My plan's working, right?

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.310
Sure...

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:05.320
Signatures, please!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.530
Kanon-<i>chan</i>?

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:07.860
What are you doing?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.030
We're trying to collect signatures.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:13.780
You would prefer to freely make
whatever club you want, right?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:14.700
Well...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.410
Then sign, please!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.460
This is bad. What if Hazuki-<i>san </i>finds out?

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:22.330
Maybe you should keep this on the DL.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.750
You might get the music
program kids after you.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.710
"Let us freely pursue club activities!!"

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.760
That's fine. We're not
doing anything wrong.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:33.890
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:34.930
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.890
Is this your friend, Kanon-<i>san</i>?

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.730
The director...

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.810
The director!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.520
Let us freely pursue club activities!!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:48.820
So that's why you were
trying to collect signatures.

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.150
Yes! We have something we want to do

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:54.490
and thought it was wrong
that we couldn't do it freely.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:55.740
Well, Hazuki-<i>san</i>.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.120
Is it true that you wouldn't
allow them to form this club?

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.910
I do not remember interfering
with their freedom with any clubs.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.960
You did.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.500
Just school idols.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.710
And what's wrong with school idols?!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.260
I'm certain that I already told you.

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:12.800
I believe I understand what's going on.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:13.630
Hazuki-<i>san</i>.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:14.260
Yes?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.050
I understand your concern,

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.140
but we have no right to stop students
from the general curriculum

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.730
from pursuing their musical interests,
no matter their level.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.810
But my mother--

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:28.730
This has nothing to do with
your mother. Understood?

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:31.030
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:35.950
Our school will not prohibit
school idol activities.

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:41.660
However, as Hazuki-<i>san </i>has said,
music is the pride and joy of this school.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.170
I will give you an assignment.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.840
First place?!

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:52.630
Yes. At a festival where
the local school idols gather.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.510
That's the Yoyogi School Idol Fes?

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:59.560
She said she'd allow us to have
our club if we place first there.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:04.850
Wow, you guys have to instantly
go on stage and place first?

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:05.560
Good luck...

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.020
We're not done yet!

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.270
Whoops, my bad.
So what are you going to do?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:16.200
Well, Keke-<i>chan </i>and I decided we'd
make a song and practice that together,

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.370
but we don't know how to dance
or do choreography at all.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:20.490
Mm-hm.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:23.290
The recent school idols are super good.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.460
So we were wondering...

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.670
We were wondering...

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:29.130
--Could you teach us
how to dance, Chi-<i>chan</i>?
--Could you teach us
how to dance, Chisato-<i>san</i>?

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.040
Me?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.170
Please!

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:37.430
Oh, fine. But my lesson fees
are pretty steep!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:38.510
You'll do it?!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.810
Yeah. I'd love to if you'll have me.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:43.470
Yay!

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.810
Now we'll be unstoppable as dancers!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:49.610
Everyone's admired Chi-<i>chan</i>'s dancing
skills since we were in grade school!

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:53.570
Why don't you become a school idol
with us, Chisato-<i>san</i>?

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:54.400
Me?!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.740
Yes, please!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:58.530
She can't, Keke-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:02.450
Chi-<i>chan</i>'s in the music program. I can't
ask her to go out of her way anymore.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.120
I see...

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.250
Okay, first, let's see what you've got!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:11.380
We'll start with some simple steps.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.090
Okay!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.130
One, two, three, four,

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.260
five, six, seven, eight!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.430
One, two, three, four,

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:21.470
five, six... seven... eight...

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:25.390
Huh?

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.930
Keke-<i>chan</i>?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.020
I forgot to mention one thing...

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:33.650
I'm terrible at sports...

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:34.780
Flop.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:38.740
Keke-<i>chan</i>!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:41.160
You're kidding!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.250
Nope...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.870
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:02.220
Wow, this looks amazing!

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.350
I guess I've got the wrong spot.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.150
Wow, Sunny Pas!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.940
They're so cool!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.650
Sunny Pas?

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.580
I think I've worked you two
hard enough today...

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.670
I-I can't breathe...

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:32.710
She seriously has...

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.330
...zero stamina.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.460
Flop.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.590
Oh, come on! You're hopeless!

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:39.920
How did you plan on
being an idol like this?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.050
It's all about heart.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.800
The most important thing
about school idols is heart!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:45.930
I see...

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:51.060
By the way, I can totally get
perfect combos in rhythm games.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.560
Like, tap, tap, tap.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.730
That doesn't help.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.980
But that does mean
she has a sense of rhythm.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:57.820
You're so positive.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:59.650
Tap, tap, tap.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.110
But we only have a little bit of time.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.200
It'll be time before you know it.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:09.370
Regardless, you can't be a school idol
with that level of stamina.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.410
If we keep this up, you'll be able to
build up your stamina

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.540
so we'll fit in some
dance lessons along the way.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.420
Can you do that?

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:17.840
I can!

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:22.130
That's it for today.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.380
We'll start dance lessons tomorrow.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.550
Thank you so much!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.760
<i>Xiè xiè!</i>

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.640
Oh, yeah. We have to
start making our song, too.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.770
Oh, right. You've still
got that to do, too.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.190
I have some.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.980
I actually have some lyrics written.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.400
Though part of it is in Chinese.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.200
Wow!

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.120
{=6}I want to sing!! And

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:56.290
This is lovely. I think this is great!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.580
Really?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:03.220
Yeah! I'll take good care of these lyrics
you wrote and make a song.

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.970
We're not going to give up.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:15.230
Wait. Is this homework?
I guess it wouldn't be.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:19.570
It is. Homework from my friend.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.440
There're Chinese dictionaries
in Dad's room, right?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.700
Of course there are. He's a translator.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:27.240
Dad.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.700
Japanese - Chinese Dictionary

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:30.910
Wow...

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.950
I haven't seen her so absorbed in a while.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:38.080
By the way, is there even
a Chinese class in high school?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.210
No idea.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.760
I-I can't breathe...

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.890
Good job.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.550
You did a great job.

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.550
Flop.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.390
One, two, three, four,

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:54.310
five, six, seven, eight!

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.100
One, two, three, four,

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.270
five, six, seven, eight!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.260
I can't believe she fell asleep there.

