00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:20.450
Keke-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.080
Vwoom!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.080
Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.630
Let's run together!

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.340
Okay.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.350
You know...

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:47.100
When I failed to get into
the music program,

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.770
I thought everything was over.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.730
I graduated, had spring break,

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:57.740
entered high school,
but I thought it was all over.

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:00.780
I thought things were just
going to continue to be over.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.240
But...

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.790
It's finally starting!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.500
The new me...

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:09.000
...gets to start!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.550
It's really pretty.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:19.680
Yeah.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.180
Oh yeah. I finished the song.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:27.270
I'd love to hear it!

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:30.310
There're other people here
so it's embarrassing.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:32.310
I'll send you the file later.

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.740
Will you sing it for me?

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:44.370
Will you sing it for me here?
I want to see you singing it.

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:46.700
I want to hear your song, Kanon-<i>san</i>.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:52.710
Keke-<i>chan</i>... I'm not sure if I can.

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:54.630
Let's let it resonate!

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:58.840
Let's fill this town with your
magnificent singing voice, Kanon-<i>san</i>!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:18.820
<i>The future is calling to us</i>

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:21.650
<i>Like the wind</i>

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:27.870
<i>No one knows what the future holds for us</i>

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:32.210
<i>Even then, we want to move forward</i>

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:35.710
<i>Because we don't want to have any regrets</i>

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:39.340
<i>You can't hold down our hearts</i>

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:43.510
<i>Let's all be free</i>

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:46.970
<i>We're not going to give up!</i>

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:50.560
<i>Because we decided that</i>

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:53.600
<i>We'll cry, laugh, and do our best</i>

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:57.940
<i>We all want to surpass our limits</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:02.190
<i>It's important to believe</i>

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:05.740
<i>And once we told ourselves that</i>

00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:12.750
<i>Let's try to go even further</i>

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:20.590
<i>We may be small, but we have big dreams</i>

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:27.610
<i>We won't give in, now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:35.220
<i>Let's fly the best we can,</i>
<i>now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:41.020
Kuu Kaa

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:41.020
Kuu Kaa

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:39.980
Next time, "Kuu Kaa."
